cHCL0BKAg",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["昨晚臨時想吃拉麵跟唐揚雞，看到這家有，今天馬上衝來，真的很好吃。\n湯頭選了赤蝦味噌，濃郁好喝但也不會過鹹，麵是中太麵，Q而不爛，很搭，肉類選擇有肥有瘦的肋眼叉燒，也很好吃。\n而且這家還有燙青菜，甚至能選擇不加胡麻醬改鹽巴，唐揚雞也非常多汁好好吃。\n溏心蛋蛋黃顏色比較深(?)但也是好吃。每樣餐點都很棒，服務跟環境都很好。",null,[0,160]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4639299691065376168/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXUkZKRlNtOWxXRkpPVGtab1ZGUlViRVppU0ZwU1VXNXJkMkpYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4639299691065376168/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXUkZKRlNtOWxXRkpPVGtab1ZGUlViRVppU0ZwU1VXNXJkMkpYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4639299691065376168/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXUkZKRlNtOWxXRkpPVGtab1ZGUlViRVppU0ZwU1VXNXJkMkpYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4639299691065376168/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXUkZKRlNtOWxXRkpPVGtab1ZGUlViRVppU0ZwU1VXNXJkMkpYWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4639299691065376168/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXUkZKRlNtOWxXRkpPVGtab1ZGUlViRVppU0ZwU1VXNXJkMkpYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4639299691065376168/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXUkZKRlNtOWxXRkpPVGtab1ZGUlViRVppU0ZwU1VXNXJkMkpYWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,3465,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WRFJFSm9lWFJOTkZoVFRUbEZiSFpSUW5rd2JXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1c23d650a48f1c95!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmVDREJoeXRNNFhTTTlFbHZRQnkwbWc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WRFJFSm9lWFJOTkZoVFRUbEZiSFpSUW5rd2JXYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WRFJFSm9lWFJOTkZoVFRUbEZiSFpSUW5rd2JXYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WRFJFSm9lWFJOTkZoVFRUbEZiSFpSU